    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "In a case where the company ... is an employer in respect of an eligible scheme, any notice or other document required to be sent to a creditor" (the requirement does not arise)
    ELSE IF `the notice or other document has also been sent to the Board of the Pension Protection Fund`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must also be sent to the Board of the Pension Protection Fund" (a bare "must" not done: fork F3)

