    WHEN `s 901I(9) in subsections (2) and (3)` THEN `the person is an employer within the meaning given for the purposes of Part 2 of the Pensions Act 2004 or Part 3 of the Pensions (Northern Ireland) Order 2005 for an eligible scheme` -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): borrowed from the Pensions Act 2004 (section 318(1) and (4)) or the 2005 Order

